Aragonite Alexandria Server
Copyright 2026 jdkruzr

This product selectively incorporates behavior and, where noted in source
headers, code from UltraBridge, also licensed under Apache License 2.0.

Ported behavioral surfaces:
- UltraBridge task field and synchronization semantics (initial task store)
- ForestNote URI helpers
- Device source sync-model descriptors
- Alexandria device identity and enrollment (internal/alexandria/identity)
- Alexandria library generation fence (internal/alexandria/generation)
- Alexandria reader contract: registry, validation, projections
  (internal/alexandria/contract, copied with tests)
- Alexandria shared-library protocol host assembly (internal/alexandria/host)
- Alexandria relay: op log, LWW merge, bounded exchange, server authoring
  (internal/alexandria/relay, with ported tests)
- Alexandria reader inbox, materialization, change journal and snapshots
  (internal/alexandria/reader, with ported tests)
- Alexandria assets-v1 store over PostgreSQL and S3, following Rhizome's
  assets.SQLStore state machine (internal/alexandria/assetstore, with tests
  ported from UltraBridge internal/syncassets)
- Alexandria authoritative restore and adoption (internal/alexandria/restore,
  with tests ported from UltraBridge internal/libraryrestore)
- Alexandria interop fixture following UltraBridge cmd/assetlab's command-line
  contract (cmd/alexandria-lab)
- Notebook page renderer (internal/alexandria/render, from internal/forestrender),
  recognition client (internal/alexandria/ocr, from internal/processor), text
  chunking and Ollama embeddings (internal/alexandria/embed, from internal/rag),
  and the page pipeline and hybrid note search behavior (internal/alexandria/notes,
  from internal/syncbridge and internal/rag)
- Alexandria annotation search (internal/alexandria/readersearch, with tests
  ported from UltraBridge internal/readersearch)
